   "design": "The modeling software applies the alloy's shrinkage factor to the whole model and standard draft and machining allowances to selected faces by rule, instead of adding them feature by feature; the patternmaker adjusts faces where the rule does not fit. Reading drawings, modeling, splitting, foundry talks, corrections, the check, release and the register stay with the patternmaker.",
